#TASK

PLEASE improve and rewrite the class
especially process_job_descriptions function


输出job_desc， Category， 里面每个专业 ，还有个评分的属性（你计算的相似度）
{
"关键line":{
  "匹配规则":"Category score > 90, include all majors in category",
  "匹配Category1": {
"匹配专业major名称1":"打分"，
"匹配专业major名称2":"打分"，
...
},
...
}
}

规则：
1. 如果和category分数在90以上，就把一个category下所有的major拿到；
2. 如果category分数在80以上，就把一个category下，major分数在70分以上的拿到；
3. 如果category分数低于80，就把所有major分数在80分以上的拿到



NOTICE: 
assume the metioned function and variables are imported

引入：
```python

    def _format_rule_description(self, rule_key: str) -> str:
        """Generate human-readable rule descriptions"""
        descriptions = {
            "category_high_score": "Category score > 90, include all majors in category",
            "category_medium_score": "Category score ≥80, majors score ≥70",
            "direct_major_match": "Category score <80, direct major match ≥80"
        }
        return descriptions.get(rule_key, "Unknown matching rule")
```
